   An unofficial consolidation of Undang-Undang Nomor 40 Tahun 2007 tentang
   Perseroan Terbatas (LN 2007 No. 106, TLN No. 4756), prepared by the
   operator before the hackathon and consolidated as of 30 December 2022.
   It incorporates Perppu 2/2022 (enacted by UU 6/2023), UU 24/2011, and
   Constitutional Court decision No. 84/PUU-XI/2013; the file's frontmatter
   lists the sources. Under UU 28/2014 tentang Hak Cipta, Article 42,
   regulations are not protected by copyright. This text is not relicensed
   by this project and is not an official LN/BN copy.

